        "text_hz4abV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Experience skincare inspired by generations of African wisdom and thoughtfully crafted for modern lifestyles. Our grass-fed tallow body butter is made with nutrient-rich, skin-loving ingredients that closely resemble your skin's natural oils, allowing them to absorb deeply and nourish from within. Every jar is handcrafted in small batches to deliver exceptional quality, purity, and performance.</p><p>Unlike traditional lotions that rely on water and synthetic fillers, Sankofa Tallow provides long-lasting hydration while helping restore your skin's natural moisture barrier. Free from parabens, sulfates, petroleum, and unnecessary chemicals, our simple yet effective formula leaves skin feeling softer, healthier, and beautifully nourished—making it a trusted choice for the entire family.</p>",
